{
  "Battle for Stonehenge (normal)": "巨石阵之战（一般）",
  "A mountainous area which is dominated by a powerful Roman AI. The map holds five players whose goal is to eliminate the AI.\\nIt is strongly recommended that all players play in one team.": "一片由强大罗马电脑势力主宰的山地。地图可容纳五名玩家，目标是消灭该电脑势力。\\n强烈建议所有玩家组成同一队伍。",
  "Four kingdoms (normal)": "四大王国（一般）",
  "A map with mountainous terrain and narrow passages, with a central Roman stronghold that can give an advantage to the player who manages to keep it.\\n": "山地地形、通道狭窄的地图，中央有一座罗马要塞，能守住的玩家将取得优势。\\n",
  "I of the sea (normal)": "海之眼（一般）",
  "A large island map that is filled with neutral forces that guard various areas. The battles could take place either on the central island or those surrounding it. \\nThe map is best suited for two teams of two players each.": "大型岛屿地图，各处要地皆有中立部队驻守。战斗可在中央岛屿或周边岛屿展开。\\n最适合两队各两名玩家对战。",
  "Island chaos (normal)": "群岛混战（一般）",
  "An island map that has three large islands, with two strongholds each. While players could attack each other on sea and land there are things to be gained by exploring the smaller islands.\\nThe map is best suited for three teams of two players each.": "岛屿地图，共有三座大岛，每座各有两处要塞。玩家可在海上与陆地互相攻击，探索小岛也能有所收获。\\n最适合三队各两名玩家对战。",
  "Island troubles (huge)": "岛屿风云（巨大）",
  "A sea map in which battles could take place in sea as well as on land. Four of the players start on their own separate islands, while the rest have direct contact with one another.": "海洋地图，海战与陆战皆可展开。其中四名玩家各据一座独立岛屿，其余玩家则彼此接壤。",
  "Island war (normal)": "岛屿战争（一般）",
  "An islands map in which the western islands are occupied by Gauls and the eastern by Romans. There exist also a number of neutral islands populated by Teutons, which will give an advantage to the person who captures them.\\nThe map is best suited for two teams of three players each.": "岛屿地图，西侧岛屿由高卢人占据，东侧则属罗马人。另有数座中立岛屿住着条顿人，攻下者可获得优势。\\n最适合两队各三名玩家对战。",
  "Mountain battlegrounds (normal)": "山地战场（一般）",
  "A land map that gives the players the opportunity to match the strength of their armies in the mountainous circle in the middle of the area.": "陆地地图，玩家可在地图中央的环形山区一较高下。",
  "North and South (normal)": "南与北（一般）",
  "A land map with a mountain chain that splits the area in two, which makes the passage from one part to the other difficult. \\nThe map is best suited for two teams of three players each.": "陆地地图，一道山脉将地域一分为二，往来十分不易。\\n最适合两队各三名玩家对战。",
  "River of Teutons (normal)": "条顿之河（一般）",
  "A map with two teams of three players each in which the participants are additionally burdened by the constant attack of passing Teutons, as well as a large number of Teuton tents in the area.": "两队各三名玩家的地图，除了彼此交战，还得应付不断路过的条顿人袭击，区域内也散布着大量条顿帐篷。",
  "Riverside (small)": "河畔（小型）",
  "A land map with a river dividing the area in two parts - one under Roman control, the other belonging to the Gauls.\\nThe map is best suited for head to head games.\\n": "陆地地图，一条河将地域分为两半——一半由罗马控制，另一半属於高卢。\\n最适合一对一对战。\\n",
  "Shattered lands (normal)": "破碎之地（一般）",
  "A coastal map with two major peninsulas, one governed by the Romans, the other by the Gauls. Because of the broken terrain battles are possible in sea as well as on land.\\nThe map is best suited for two teams of four players each.\\n": "海岸地图，有两座大型半岛，一座由罗马人统治，另一座属於高卢。地形破碎，海战与陆战皆可进行。\\n最适合两队各四名玩家对战。\\n",
  "The battle for survival (normal)": "生存之战（一般）",
  "A land mission in which the player must escape the lake he is prisoner of and capture a stronghold in less than 3 minutes, before doing anything else.\\nThis map can be played only by human players.\\n": "陆地任务，玩家必须先逃出被囚禁的湖区，并在三分钟内攻下一座要塞，才能做其他事情。\\n本地图只能由真人玩家游玩。\\n",
  "The cross shaped islands (normal)": "十字群岛（一般）",
  "A sea map filled with islands of various sizes, where the players don't always have direct access with one another.": "海洋地图，散布着大小不一的岛屿，玩家之间不一定能直接往来。",
  "The deadly triangle (normal)": "致命三角（一般）",
  "A three person map in which every player is for himself, and while attacking one's enemies directly could lead to victory there are a number of islands that could give an advantage to those who dare seek it.": "三人地图，各自为战。直接攻击敌人固然可能取胜，但地图上还有数座岛屿，敢於探索者将获得优势。",
  "The mountain wall (normal)": "山之壁（一般）",
  "A land map with two teams of three players each, in which both sides are separated by a large mountain chain that separates the area in two.": "陆地地图，两队各三名玩家，双方被一道贯穿地域的大山脉隔开。",
  "The northern coast (normal)": "北方海岸（一般）",
  "A coastal map with rough terrain that focuses mainly on land battles.\\nThe map is best suited for free-for-all games.": "海岸地图，地形崎岖，以陆战为主。\\n最适合混战模式。",
  "The Teuton Sun (huge)": "条顿之日（巨大）",
  "A land map abundant with numerous lakes that make traveling difficult. The one who manages to gain control of the Roman stronghold guarded by a vast number of Teutons in the center of the area will gain a great advantage.": "陆地地图，湖泊众多，行军困难。地图中央的罗马要塞由大批条顿人守卫，能拿下者将取得极大优势。",
  "Trial of heroes (normal)": "英雄试炼（一般）",
  "A land map with rough terrain in which each player is given a hero to start with. Since no heroes can be built each player must protect his hero as best he could.": "陆地地图，地形崎岖，每位玩家一开始就有一名英雄。由於无法再招募英雄，玩家必须全力保护自己的英雄。",
  "Volcano (small)": "火山（小型）",
  "A mountainous map in which the four strongholds are located near a huge volcano. Because of this there is absolutely no vegetation in the area, nor are there any neutral enemies.\\n": "山地地图，四座要塞环绕着一座巨大火山。因此区域内完全没有植被，也没有任何中立敌人。\\n",
  "X marks the spot (normal)": "宝藏所在（一般）",
  "An island map that combines land battles and sea travel. While the players could concentrate their battles on the central island, there exist four smaller islands that could be explored.\\n": "岛屿地图，兼具陆战与航海。玩家可将战斗集中在中央岛屿，但周围还有四座小岛可供探索。\\n",
